@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "WenQuanYi Micro Hei"
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor 玩家
participant "浏览器公共外壳" as Web
participant "房间连接网关" as Gateway
participant "房间串行队列" as Queue
participant "Game Host" as Host
participant "游戏 Server 插件" as Plugin
participant "Deadline Scheduler" as Scheduler
collections "玩家 / 观众连接" as Peers

玩家 -> Web : 提交插件定义的游戏动作
Web -> Gateway : game.action（WS 或 HTTP）\nrequestId + expectedRevision
Gateway -> Gateway : 会话、大小、频率校验\n记录 receivedAt
Gateway -> Queue : 提交不可变命令
Queue -> Queue : 幂等、房间、对局、控制权校验
Queue -> Host : handleGameAction(context, payload)
Host -> Plugin : handleAction(state, action)
Plugin --> Host : 新状态 + 展示事件 + outcome
Host -> Plugin : projectView(state, viewer)
Plugin --> Host : 玩家或观众投影视图
Host --> Queue : 转换结果与各接收者快照
Queue -> Queue : 原子替换状态，revision + 1
Queue -> Scheduler : 更新有效截止任务
Queue -> Peers : room.snapshot\n各自投影 + 展示事件
Peers --> Web : 当前玩家收到新快照
Web --> 玩家 : 立即更新状态并播放短动画
@enduml
